{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "0235ed62d906890e3d4fb17eb61925227bf6890fc4b09977d3b3f421da89eaae", "ja": "みんな立派なお姉ちゃん", "zh": "大家都是优秀的姐姐", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "42ff91e6f2116928270cc3902b649fffc11f2ec7f86b02f5d2c4f5c8d30972f8", "ja": "無事に撮影を終えて、打ち上げの開始を待つ\nアイドル達。プロデューサーは、見事主演の\n大役を果たした瑞希に賛辞を贈るが、やきも\nちをやく桃子や育に詰め寄られてしまう。そ\nの光景を微笑ましく見つめる瑞希達だった。", "zh": "偶像们顺利结束拍摄，等待庆功宴开始。制作人向出色完成主演重任的瑞希送上赞美，却被吃醋的桃子和育逼问。瑞希等人微笑着注视着那一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "de06f065cb03f9c6438d4ed4cb830c58b2d0a5cd0ad63c0999aa30a7d6d191c9", "ja": "（瑞希たちの頑張りによって、\n映画『彼ハ誰ノ彼岸』の撮影は無事に終了した！）", "zh": "（多亏瑞希她们的努力，电影《彼ハ誰ノ彼岸》的拍摄顺利结束了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "91057611c499c213a1064c99c0dca3b382891adf5f9f3223e211ddfd6810a2f8", "ja": "（みんな緊張から解放されて、いい顔をしているな。\n今日の打ち上げでは、盛大に労ってあげないと！）", "zh": "（大家终于从紧张中解放出来了，脸色都不错嘛。今天的庆功宴上，可得好好慰劳大家一番！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "99c7c48339b668306d2848b4c67366991c96a1fc15a9c0f26e3cc10df973cca5", "ja": "病院でのしーんで、不思議な影をみたような……。\nあれはなんだったのでしょう？", "zh": "在医院的那一幕里，好像看到了什么奇怪的影子……  \n那到底是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "2cc71f480895dc7a2a7c9ffcefb1ceb8b829f806c284511ea932813776aaaa4e", "ja": "も、桃子そんなの見てない……。\n貴音さんの勘違いだよ……ね、ねえ育？", "zh": "桃、桃子才没有看到那种东西……\n是贵音小姐看错了吧……对、对吧，育？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "fa063afee4bbd012689b09933629b5c7d5290b9b1895ca41e78aef2a6328792d", "ja": "うん……。\nきっとスタッフさんじゃないかな……。", "zh": "嗯……。\n肯定只是工作人员吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "657f536b6a9aa20e057d6e9cde965719e244f55a7035eb2a914950cb5fdd3621", "ja": "うーらーめーしーやー。", "zh": "呜——啦——咩——西——呀——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "482649c6bf44f66111eb6c8a1a22e921ae415e6c875455e5c369d2e88afdb866", "ja": "きゃあっ！？", "zh": "呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "482649c6bf44f66111eb6c8a1a22e921ae415e6c875455e5c369d2e88afdb866", "ja": "きゃあっ！？", "zh": "呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "20c470a4f95abb4576d2e64e69515ebccabad9fa0a0656c675b1b4eac2f80453", "ja": "あっ、もう、瑞希さんっ！", "zh": "啊，真是的，瑞希小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "1d17539ebfc2654f0bd81999b199521850f4c5e0f5bc7e05dccb5425b6bc46b9", "ja": "すみません。少々驚かせようとしたつもりが、\n驚かせすぎてしまったようです。", "zh": "对不起。我本来只是想稍微吓你一下，看来好像吓过头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "db43ad1eb72cb451c0a14346176ff59736e5e372a54d1e9229d1a7b0243dff0c", "ja": "心臓が飛び出しちゃったかと思った……。\nあれ、あそこにいるのって。", "zh": "我还以为心脏都要跳出来了呢……\n咦，在那边的难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "558fda14a86c97742c766dff0794640697d8a52400df57d3fb7de5a4bbb2387d", "ja": "その手には乗りません。\n何もあるはず……あ。", "zh": "我才不会上你的当。\n那里应该什么都没有……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "883ccaf7e095019c50270d09d3b87e63a6b01113b0f46a5bc529a474eeb47d68", "ja": "このみと、{$P$}ですね。\n泣いているように見えますが……。", "zh": "是木实和{$P$}吧。看起来像是在哭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "a4f2c25017c837556f3fea09ca4c0ead8871b9a73e0ca6048d6e503273219d20", "ja": "うっ、ううっ……。", "zh": "呜，呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d247981cdc63011f2635d572067b633b64da13f39f6246e7521b6a0e20efd43c", "ja": "こ、このみさん。\nすみません、泣かないでください……。", "zh": "小、这个美。\n对不起，请别哭……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "5c5b444b4a8a579899fa8e11e895bb990d09e8d1e07616169df8f66b5801d496", "ja": "なんと、トラブルでしょうか。\nもしや、{$P$}が……。", "zh": "莫非是出了什么问题吗？难道是{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "b6cd7f5f8a916fdfa387c018f866c8df78e47349e131cefb73317157265ce50a", "ja": "ううん、違うの。{$P$}と\n撮影の話をしてたら、思い出しちゃって……ぐす。", "zh": "不，不是那样。和{$P$}聊到拍摄的事，我就想起来了……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "cffc6b65c7aa19566ec599476a25dc5eb6b403424c598d6b1f7c5bef23a4270e", "ja": "怖いシーンとか、悲しいシーンとか……\nどれも大変だったでしょ？", "zh": "可怕的场景、悲伤的场景……\n每一场都很不容易吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "e8d4313c5e2e294c0cdde0710705dccd9cf7c7b798fa4684024c38364101243c", "ja": "けど、みんな「いい作品にしよう」って一生懸命で。\nそれを思ったら、感極まっちゃって……ううっ。", "zh": "不过，大家都在拼命想着“要把作品拍好”。一想到这些，我就情不自禁了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "227cab03a512c0f763d171c27b38f4cadb260d8d38f7f0b719dacf694b9c996f", "ja": "このみは、私達をよく見てくれていましたから。この\n撮影を乗り切れたのは、このみのおかげでもあります。", "zh": "因为可妮米一直都很关注我们。能顺利撑过这次拍摄，也有可妮米的功劳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "1a3d8da0c8e0fce6678951c5fead094324881278ebe3989d84622a36683e6f86", "ja": "もう……貴音ちゃんにそんなこと言われたら、\nまた泣けてきちゃうじゃない……！", "zh": "真是的……贵音你这么一说，\n人家又要忍不住哭出来了啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "fb1c1dacbcafde1d3e3c363b7cc4c837a09417db5b553afe968cdb5ecf4b0caa", "ja": "このみさん……よしよし。\nこれから打ち上げなんだから、ないちゃダメだよ？", "zh": "この美小姐……乖乖。\n接下来还要去庆功宴呢，不能哭哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "cf38fe17b09e936e88559d24a1392ec52189da4a9f2cbdb5bb385477faed97ac", "ja": "ふふっ。今はこのみさんより、\n育のほうがお姉ちゃんみたい。", "zh": "呵呵。现在比起木实姐，育反而更像姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "f0bc82ad5a3d5c96fdae85e1ab290dcde71e49bae66b659a1d719cc6a0b4aa81", "ja": "なんと。お姉ちゃん激戦区に、中谷さんまでもが。\n……強力なライバル登場、だぞ。", "zh": "什么。没想到连中谷也加入了姐姐竞争区。\n……强劲的对手登场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "e4c7fc5c77e8a8678e83fdfaba5e896bf804c53841d323990dacba92046b9c86", "ja": "えっ、本当？　わたしも、このみさんの\nお姉ちゃんになっていいの？　一番年下だけど……。", "zh": "咦，真的吗？我也能当好美的姐姐吗？我可是年龄最小的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "dd2b2944391b305e4717c55c3049eaeb64378fdb9c3ed8d4f15bea534f1b617c", "ja": "年齢だけではありません。育の頑張りから考えれば、\nその資格は十分にあると思います。", "zh": "并不只是看年龄。考虑到育的努力，\n我认为你完全有这个资格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "b3cecf8e8282aad9bff8a2494e4e67a15a6de630ec2d9ba4e22b3bb6c3df3251", "ja": "うん、そうだね。\n育、ありがとう。育とお芝居できて、楽しかった！", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n育，谢谢你。能和育一起演戏，我很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "8485f9ef28d95eae9e8bda330c7bfbe341feb420488c69e85af549d4826eb884", "ja": "桃子ちゃん……うん！　わたしも！", "zh": "桃子……嗯！我也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "800bfea066f8242f40078c8e45ce6552259b5d7c3a4e30d2e331ad376a79940b", "ja": "育ちゃん、桃子ちゃん……\nふたりとも、とってもお姉さんよ……！　ううっ！", "zh": "育、桃子……你们两个都特别像姐姐哦……！呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "b335cfe56c9ccfd5403b9590780800a9279a8bb6adbcd25bcd164e4e4e3cfbee", "ja": "馬場さん、また泣いてしまいました。\n……よしよし。", "zh": "马场小姐又哭起来了。\n……乖乖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "1746deb10f7e91b5e8f4de88ec76498de8291baa24444ebf5094ed59411a960b", "ja": "実際、みんなよく頑張っていたと思うよ。\n瑞希も、よく大役を果たしたな。お疲れさま！", "zh": "实际上，我觉得大家都非常努力了哦。\n瑞希也是，很好地完成了重任呢。辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "2bd23aa4bdd884c7857050cfe1e9dc6fdfb9aa9ebb7b9ccec571a8a5cc0aaf1d", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……ほめられすぎて、ニヤニヤが止まりません。", "zh": "谢谢。\n……被夸得太多，忍不住一直傻笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "1fe60158f7c1cac707eddb53c21d9f3aa63bec4cc9bd134ef0dd56499b269b01", "ja": "ねえお兄ちゃん、桃子はほめてくれないの？\n瑞希さんだけズルい！", "zh": "呐，哥哥，为什么不夸夸桃子？\n只夸瑞希姐姐，太狡猾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "12ffe1c696d60c31f7a2c1e6b10bf8e3f8fe1ecc6c4708554cbde2a3035980ea", "ja": "そうだよ、{$P$}さん！\nわたしたちもがんばったよ！", "zh": "对呀，{$P$}先生！\n我们也努力过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "380338fd43ea6c02406351c1ac2cbeaabe70b381056fd81733b1b05d4ca99158", "ja": "はは、そうだな。ごめんごめん。桃子も育も、貴音も\nこのみさんも、アイドルとしてさらに成長したよ！", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。抱歉抱歉。桃子、育、贵音，还有好美姐，也都作为偶像进一步成长了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "f5ddffd0df2105017d14e067d6aea59e6d23b3c39bc2350ccfb300fa57037bf8", "ja": "なんかひとまとめにして、適当じゃない？\nやっぱり、瑞希さんだけヒイキしてる……。", "zh": "总觉得你把大家一股脑儿归到一起了，很敷衍吧？\n果然，你就只偏袒瑞希……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1036_030iku", "source_sha256": "7bab3b8b5ae5fc6a03a80a0aed13fbd5ebff77adac6d9cfa7d73341410e79194", "ja": "うんうん！\nそういうのって、よくないと思うな。", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n我觉得那样不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1037_p", "source_sha256": "b249a7ad40c0b200d8de6d7bfa7ce493b8b7cdbca6fa3e2d6f70508d72480271", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんなつもりじゃ……。", "zh": "诶！？我不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1038_030iku", "source_sha256": "8dd3a55acf923dcb7254c90e81bafe0e2782492979692264917cd0d545df47cd", "ja": "{$P$}さん、もっとほめて！\nほめてくれないと、イタズラしちゃうんだから！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，再多夸夸我嘛！\n你不夸我的话，我可要恶作剧了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0304_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "0a1167266471cf7796d6b0fcbb160b5d079567c6ba3075f71358f746b7855e23", "ja": "えっ？　ふたりとも、何を……\nた、貴音、瑞希！　助けてくれ～！", "zh": "诶？你们两个，这是在干什么……\n贵音、瑞希！救救我啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
